                <h3>Prepare</h3>
                <p>Define the property's story, audience and marketing priorities.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="pm-step">
                <div class="pm-number">02</div>
                <h3>Capture</h3>
                <p>Create photography, video, aerial and immersive content.</p>
