            </div>

            <div class="pm-goal">
                <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i>
                <h3>Launch</h3>
                <p>
                    Create a strong visual foundation for a new development or
                    property release.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="pm-goal">
                <i class="fas fa-building"></i>
                <h3>Showcase</h3>
                <p>
                    Build an impressive digital presentation for premium spaces,
